msgctxt "64"
msgid "There you are!"
msgstr "Eccoti!"

msgctxt "76"
msgid "I'm here to collect for the damage you did to my car! So pay up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"You signed an agreement, didn't ya? Well, the repairs are\r\n"
"already underway, so I need that money pronto."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Turns out it's gonna run you five million, and that's just\r\n"
"for the metalwork. The total's gonna be way higher."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"That's highway robbery. There's no way anyone could pay that\r\n"
"much all of a sudden."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Don't forget, we got your signature, smart guy! So start paying out the ass,"
" or get your ass beat down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "You can't be serious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Look, if you've got a problem, we can talk it over in detail\r\n"
"at the office! Now get a move on!"
msgstr ""

